    <statement><p>For this problem, you will need to use the
<url href="">Desmos Riemann Sum Calculator</url>.
(This link opens a new tab/window.)</p>
<p>Initially, the calculator shows a left Riemann sum with <m>n=5</m> subintervals
for the function <m>f(x)=2x+1</m> on the interval <m>[1,4]</m>. Use the applet to
compute the following sums for this function on this interval.</p>
