<p>Now use basic geometry to determine the exact area bounded by <m>f(x)=2x+1</m> and
the <m>x</m>-axis on the interval <m>[1,4]</m>.</p>
<p>Exact Area = <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0010"/></p>
<p>Make a note of any patterns you observe.</p>
<p>Now update the calculator to
