<p>However, you can observe any patterns you see in the calculations above, and make an educated
guess of the exact area bounded by <m>f(x)=x^2+1</m> and
the <m>x</m>-axis on the interval <m>[1,4]</m>.</p>
<p>Exact Area = <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0020"/></p>
